* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Source
VDD 4 0 DC VDD

* Current Source
ISS 2 8 DC Iss

* NMOS Transistors
M1 2 1 2 2 NMOS
M2 2 5 2 2 NMOS
M3 2 1 3 3 NMOS
M4 3 7 2 2 NMOS
M5 3 6 3 3 NMOS
M6 3 3 4 4 NMOS

* PMOS Transistors
M7 3 2 4 4 PMOS
M8 4 2 4 4 PMOS

* Nodes
* 1 - Vin
* 2 - Vb1
* 3 - Vb2
* 4 - Vb3
* 5 - N (Node at M6 gate)
* 6 - K (Node connecting M5 and M7 gate)
* 7 - X (Node connecting M4 gate)
* 8 - Ground